0ba4de6beb02"],

Cell["\<\
In this notebook we solve the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]viscous heat equations\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],  two differential equations for heat conduction in \
crystals that generalize Fourier\[CloseCurlyQuote]s law and explain why heat \
propagation can become fluidlike, rather than diffusive, in phononic devices.\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7531930345005817`*^9, 3.7531930825627203`*^9}, {
