Cell["\<\
Definition of the sample, which is infinite in the z direction. Dimensions \
are in micrometer and correspond to the maximum of the hydrodynamic effects \
in graphite,  see [M. Simoncelli, N. Marzari, and A. Cepellotti, Phys. Rev. X \
10, 011019 (2020)] for details.\
\>", "Text",
